New: Make IBAMR::INSStaggeredHierarchyIntegrator pass one boundary treatment, its bdry_interp_type ("LINEAR" or "QUADRATIC") and bdry_extrap_type, to the Stokes operator and preconditioners, the divergence-free velocity extension, and the velocity boundary conditions. IBAMR::StaggeredStokesOperator, IBTK::SCLaplaceOperator, IBTK::CCLaplaceOperator, IBTK::VCSCViscousOperator, and the extension apply "QUADRATIC". An object that cannot apply it uses "LINEAR". An object may override the treatment through its own keys. The integrator writes to plog the treatment of each object that differs from its own.
<br>
